SOURCE REGISTRIES KEEP THEIR OWN TERMS
This licence applies only to our compilation. The counts are derived from
public registers published by provincial and territorial regulators and
retailers (listed in data/stores-by-province.csv). Those organisations keep
whatever rights and terms apply to their own publications. We have not
confirmed that each source publishes under an open-government licence, and we
do not claim they do. This dataset contains only aggregate counts (facts), no
registry records. See "Source registries and terms" in README.md.
Nothing here is endorsed by any regulator or government.
